// The repository holds several Go modules and no longer one at its root: the
// engine is host/go, the drive libraries are lib/*/go, and the conformance
// harness is integration. This file makes them one build from here —
// `go build ./...` and `go test ./...` at the repository root — without any of
// them depending on that being true.
//
// The replace directives in each go.mod stay: they are what makes a module
// usable on its own, and what an external consumer sees.
go 1.26.0

use (
	./host/go
	./integration
	./lib/abi-drive/go
	./lib/accounts-drive/go
)
